# ==============================================================================
# 50-wireless.list: 802.11 Wireless Security & Radio Auditing
# ==============================================================================
# Instructions:
#  - To DISABLE a tool: prefix with '#' (e.g., # reaver)
#  - To REMOVE a tool:  delete the line
#  - To ADD a tool:     add the Fedora package name on a new line
# ==============================================================================

aircrack-ng                 # Complete 802.11 WEP and WPA-PSK keys cracking suite
kismet                      # Wireless network and device detector, sniffer, and WIDS
reaver                      # Brute force attack tool against Wifi Protected Setup (WPS)
